 (<ctx> ^frame <f> ^goal-ready yes ^memory-ready yes)
 (<f> ^mode act ^hunger-urgent <threshold> ^hunger < <threshold> ^food-task no ^available <a>) (<a> ^kind << eat snack cook groceries >>)
 -->
 (<s> ^operator <o> +) (<o> ^name choose ^choice <a> ^priority 1000 ^rule base*urgent-food ^reason |饿得难受，先解决吃的。|)
}
